<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Tower Semi EPS forecast.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Tower Semi EPS forecast.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robertson Stephens &amp; Co research analyst Dan Klesken raised estimates on Tower Semiconductor Ltd.</p>
<p>-- He raised his 1997 EPS estimate to $0.75 from $0.36 and introduced a 1988 estimate of $1.00.</p>
<p>-- He cited strong Q4 earnings.</p>
</text>
